  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to assist the Azerbaijan authorities in developing, and implementing the initial phases of a long-term judicial system modernization program by building capacity to achieve incremental improvements in efficiency, citizen information, and its ability to handle future demand.</narrative>
